      <rules>
        <rule name="Survivor" id="c0be-23c0-357-cee0" hidden="false">
          <description>Cannot be taken out of Action unless the model is already Knocked Down or Stunned.
Treat Out of Action as Stunned if the Conqueror is standing when receiving the Wound.


In addition, the first time a Conqueror suffers a Dead result on the Serious Injury Chart, treat it as Multiple Injuries instead.


This ability can save the Conqueror only one time.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
