                    <characteristic name="A" id="73e5-578f-aeed-883e" hidden="false" typeId="bf393c37-9d10-fc85-c147-62b1c01a89fe">1</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="LD" id="42c5-6dba-8e4c-67e" hidden="false" typeId="e234eaea-a02a-2fb7-3e1f-605392aabb89">5</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Armor Save" id="cb1b-366d-5bc4-bd06" hidden="false">
                  <description>5+ Armor Save


Beast masters raise savage Estalian warhounds: giant beasts trained to bring down any prey or enemy, and protected by padded armor to ward off arrows and iron collars against blades.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Barbary Monkey" id="f991-4ff5-9f28-6a61" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="2" type="upgrade">
