                    <characteristic name="LD" id="ca3e-7912-ed02-6036" hidden="false" typeId="e234eaea-a02a-2fb7-3e1f-605392aabb89">6</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Nimble" id="cceb-344f-2e0b-f990" hidden="false">
                  <description>Can climb any sheer surfaces without taking Initiative tests.


Can re-roll all failed Diving Charge tests.


The Monkey can enter buildings unlike other animals.


Due to it&apos;s agility, the Monkey also has a 5+ Ward Armor save which it can take against any and all wounds it suffers in Melee combat or from shooting/magic or even falling damage.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
