      <rules>
        <rule name="Silent Hunter" id="36e9-993b-e0bd-8c83" hidden="false">
          <description>Jungle Shadow is always considered to be Hidden if the model is touching any piece of terrain of 1” high. 


Shooting does not reveal Jungle Shadow’s position, though spellcasting does.
This does not work with Blackpowder weapons.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Surprise attack" id="7c3e-f2c6-ebad-1341" hidden="false">
          <description>If the Shadow attacks an enemy that has its back turned to the Jungle Shadow (ie. the shot is coming from 180 degree angle from behind it&apos;s facing), the Shadow can re-roll missed to hit rolls.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Canopy Walker" id="74fb-1cf4-5a9d-f28" hidden="false">
          <description>Jungle Shadow can re-roll all failed climbing, jumping and falling off ledges tests once.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
