      <rules>
        <rule name="Deadeye" id="a8a5-2aa8-55a2-32e3" hidden="false">
          <description>Trapmaster suffers no penalties for shooting at long range.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Traps" id="fe14-c023-3871-387f" hidden="false">
          <description>The Trapmaster starts each game with 1 Trap and can buy up to 5 further of the following Traps before the start of the game at the cost of 5 GC each.
Each trap is one use only.



Traps are used in the Shooting Phase instead of shooting (and therefore cannot be set if you run), 1 trap at a time, and cannot be used in Melee combat.


When you use a trap, put 2 1” diameter Trap counters (one false, one real) anywhere within 3” of the Trapmaster, but at least 3” away from any other models.
Any model that moves within 2” of the counter must flip it over.
If it is a false one, nothing happens.
If it is a real one, the model suffers D3 S5 Hits immediately.
Traps do not cause Criticals.
Remove the counters when the trap is sprung.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
